# Shell scripts must stay LF in the working tree. serving/validate.sh
# compares clock strings with awk; a CRLF checkout leaves a trailing \r on
# the field, so every scenario reports a false FAIL while the numeric
# delta is +0.0000% (review item F16).
#
# Deliberately ONLY *.sh: the repo ships profiler/perf CSVs that are
# compared byte-wise against recorded baselines, so normalising *.csv
# here would rewrite committed data on checkout.
*.sh text eol=lf
